      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Further to this, with my own patched build that returns the same m3u8 for both redirected urls like the ones used in my world, and raw youtube urls, I found that the youtube raw links fail to get a url and hang, yet the redirected one, pointing to the same youtube url, resolves just fine",
